{"id": 1013765, "slug": "crap-game-dont-play", "name": "Crap Game, Don’t Play", "name_original": "Crap Game, Don’t Play", "description": "<p>A so-called “crap game,” a complete and utter piece of garbage, featuring but not limited to:</p><ul><li><p>Graphics so rough they hurt your eyes, with laughable cutscenes</p></li><li><p>A broken, utterly useless user interface</p></li><li><p>Mind-numbingly boring quests designed purely to waste your time</p></li><li><p>Out-of-nowhere, meaningless old jokes</p></li><li><p>Annoying, never-ending narration that won’t shut up</p></li><li><p>A ridiculous story clumsily improvised by half-baked narrators</p></li></ul><p>Convinced yet? Ha! The joke’s on you.</p><p>In reality, this game only manages to make a blocky character wander aimlessly across a blank map… and that’s it. Nothing more. Don’t expect anything else.</p><p>Value your time, open your eyes, and stay far away from this trash.</p><p><strong>Do NOT play.</strong></p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-11-03", "tba": false, "updated": "2026-01-07T13:19:30", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/894/8949265293511e56d1d8daeea1ee64d5.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/526/5269b603d4dc89454feb02f6d7235973.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [{"id": 5, "title": "exceptional", "count": 1, "percent": 50.0}, {"id": 4, "title": "recommended", "count": 1, "percent": 50.0}], "reactions": {}, "added": 3, "added_by_status": {"beaten": 2, "toplay": 1}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 5, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 8, "parent_achievements_count": 8, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count": 0, "reviews_text_count": 0, "ratings_count": 2, "suggestions_count": 70, "alternative_names": [], "metacritic_url": "", "parents_count": 0, "add